  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1654148486754304
    m_Localized: "Geli\u015Fmi\u015F Ayarlar"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1656496193892352
    m_Localized: "Kenar Yumu\u015Fatma"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1661452141555712
    m_Localized: "\xD6nl\xFCk Stili"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 549324026376192
    m_Localized: "Sipari\u015Fe 3$ eklenir"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 549242392637440
    m_Localized: "Boba'y\u0131 75$'a sat\u0131n al\u0131n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 549277549293568
    m_Localized: "Boba'n\u0131n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 549846439522304
    m_Localized: "Sipari\u015Fe 1$ eklenir"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 549769167859712
    m_Localized: "Karamel Sosunu 25 Dolara Sat\u0131n Al"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 549811962343424
    m_Localized: karamel sosu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1683534711713792
    m_Localized: "Mand\u0131ra \xE7iftli\u011Finiz yak\u0131n zamanda pazarlamaya
      yard\u0131mc\u0131 olmak i\xE7in bir \"inek kafesi\" a\xE7maya karar verdi;
      bununla birlikte, bu ayn\u0131 zamanda siz onlar\u0131 s\xFCt g\xF6revine haz\u0131rlarken
      yeni inek k\u0131zlar\u0131na yapacak bir \u015Feyler vermenin harika bir yolu
      gibi g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCyor.\n\n\u0130lk baristan\u0131z ba\u015Flaman\u0131n heyecan\u0131n\u0131
      ya\u015F\u0131yor ve potansiyel dolu g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCyor, tam s\xFCt g\xFCc\xFCne
      ula\u015Fmaya \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131rken m\xFC\u015Fterilere hizmet etmesine
      yard\u0131mc\u0131 olun!\n\nKafe yeni oldu\u011Fundan yol boyunca yeni malzemeler
      de sat\u0131n alman\u0131z gerekecek.\nNeyse ki buradaki m\xFC\u015Fteriler,
      e\u011Fer ruh halleri iyiyse, iste\u011Fe ba\u011Fl\u0131 taze s\xFCt i\xE7in
      fazladan \xF6deme yapma fikrine olduk\xE7a s\u0131cak bak\u0131yorlar.\n\nOynarken
      daha fazla yard\u0131ma ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z olursa, \xFCzerine gelindi\u011Finde
      Ara\xE7 \u0130pu\xE7lar\u0131 bulunur."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1683396865912832
    m_Localized: "Cowtastic Cafe'ye ho\u015F geldiniz!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1684540275126272
    m_Localized: "Belki de bug\xFCn evde kalmal\u0131yd\u0131n, t\xFCm kafe kaos
      i\xE7inde, burada her t\xFCrl\xFC \xE7\u0131lg\u0131n \u015Fey oluyor!  Bu
      fiyatlar nedir?  Neden her m\xFC\u015Fteri geldi\u011Finde t\xFCm bunlar oluyor?\n\nMerhaba,
      g\xF6r\xFCn\xFC\u015Fe g\xF6re k\xFC\xE7\xFCk paskalya yumurtam\u0131z\u0131
      bulmu\u015Fsun, e\u011Fer bunu bir \u015Fekilde ilk denemende bulursan, \xF6nce
      farkl\u0131 bir mod oynamak isteyebilirsin.\n\nBu kaosun \xFCstesinden gelmek
      i\xE7in oyunun nas\u0131l \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131na dair \xE7ok
      fazla bilgiye ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z olacak ya da olmas\u0131n... D\xFCr\xFCst
      olmak gerekirse, bu yenilebilir mi?  Bulman\u0131n bir yolu var.\n\nAyr\u0131ca
      oynad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131z i\xE7in te\u015Fekk\xFCrler!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1684438634557440
    m_Localized: "CHAOS Cafe'ye ho\u015F geldiniz!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547914811535360
    m_Localized: "\u0130\xE7ecek ba\u015F\u0131na 5 dolar de\u011Ferinde"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547664034099200
    m_Localized: "100$'a \xC7ikolata Sat\u0131n Al"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 547789489926144
    m_Localized: "\xC7ikolata"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 550208105967616
    m_Localized: "Sipari\u015Fe 1,5$ eklenir"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 550089201643520
    m_Localized: "Kakao Tozu'nu 35$'a sat\u0131n al\u0131n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 550158147612672
    m_Localized: Kakao tozu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 537745180422144
    m_Localized: "50$'a Kahve Sat\u0131n Al\u0131n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 537965951807488
    m_Localized: "\u0130\xE7ecek ba\u015F\u0131na 2 dolar de\u011Ferinde"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 537790525042688
    m_Localized: Kahve
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 316567601901568
    m_Localized: "\u0130\xE7ecek ba\u015F\u0131na 2 dolar de\u011Ferinde"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 316555551666176
    m_Localized: "Vanilyal\u0131 Kremay\u0131 35$'a sat\u0131n al\u0131n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 316559485923328
    m_Localized: "Vanilyal\u0131 Kremal\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 540973469102080
    m_Localized: "\u0130\xE7ecek ba\u015F\u0131na 10 dolar de\u011Ferinde"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 540856380911616
    m_Localized: "Espressoyu 150$'a sat\u0131n al\u0131n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 540912534253568
    m_Localized: Espresso
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651431374680064
    m_Localized: "Vay vay vay bu \xE7ok fazla s\xFCt!  Sen ne yap\u0131yorsun??? 
      Onu dipsiz bir s\xFCt kuyusuna \xE7evirdin, sonu gelmez bir \u015Fekilde sokaklar\u0131
      sular alt\u0131nda b\u0131rakt\u0131n!  Bu kaos!\n\nDemek istedi\u011Fim, h\xE2l\xE2
      bundan ho\u015Flan\u0131yor ama..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1651623855484928
    m_Localized: "S\xFCt Sel!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1713462324850688
    m_Localized: "Mand\u0131ra \xE7iftli\u011Finiz yak\u0131n zamanda pazarlamaya
      yard\u0131mc\u0131 olmak i\xE7in bir \"inek kafesi\" a\xE7maya karar verdi;
      bununla birlikte, bu ayn\u0131 zamanda siz onlar\u0131 s\xFCt g\xF6revine haz\u0131rlarken
      yeni inek k\u0131zlar\u0131na yapacak bir \u015Feyler vermenin harika bir yolu
      gibi g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCyor.\n\n\u0130lk baristan\u0131z ba\u015Flaman\u0131n heyecan\u0131n\u0131
      ya\u015F\u0131yor ve potansiyel dolu g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCyor, tam s\xFCt g\xFCc\xFCne
      ula\u015Fmaya \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131rken m\xFC\u015Fterilere hizmet etmesine
      yard\u0131mc\u0131 olun!\n\nKafe yeni oldu\u011Fundan yol boyunca yeni malzemeler
      de sat\u0131n alman\u0131z gerekecek.\nNeyse ki buradaki m\xFC\u015Fteriler,
      e\u011Fer ruh halleri iyiyse, iste\u011Fe ba\u011Fl\u0131 taze s\xFCt i\xE7in
      fazladan \xF6deme yapma fikrine olduk\xE7a s\u0131cak bak\u0131yorlar.\n\nOynamay\u0131
      \xF6\u011Frenmediyseniz \xF6nce Normal Modu deneyin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1685107663794176
    m_Localized: "Cowtastic Cafe'ye ho\u015F geldiniz!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 537416976134144
    m_Localized: "Sipari\u015Fe 0,50$ eklenir"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 537330950959104
    m_Localized: "5$'a Buz sat\u0131n al"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 537370968813568
    m_Localized: buz
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1650345817501696
    m_Localized: "Hata!  G\xF6r\xFCn\xFC\u015Fe g\xF6re onu biraz fazla ileri g\xF6t\xFCrd\xFCn. 
      Onu \xE7ok mu uzun s\xFCre tok b\u0131rakt\u0131n?  Belki biraz zor m\xFC\u015Fteri
      hizmetleri?\n\nUmar\u0131m sakinle\u015Ftikten sonra i\u015Fi tekrar denemek
      i\xE7in geri d\xF6ner."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1650204792418304
    m_Localized: "Ana men\xFC"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1649997711241216
    m_Localized: Tekrar deneyin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1650511282794496
    m_Localized: Oyun bitti
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 316273224675328
    m_Localized: "\u0130\xE7ecek ba\u015F\u0131na 1 dolar de\u011Ferinde"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 312927965245440
    m_Localized: "50 Dolara Normal S\xFCt Sat\u0131n Al\u0131n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 316153368244224
