      farkl\u0131 bir mod oynamak isteyebilirsin.\n\nBu kaosun \xFCstesinden gelmek
      i\xE7in oyunun nas\u0131l \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131na dair \xE7ok
      fazla bilgiye ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z olacak ya da olmas\u0131n... D\xFCr\xFCst
      olmak gerekirse, bu yenilebilir mi?  Bulman\u0131n bir yolu var.\n\nAyr\u0131ca
      oynad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131z i\xE7in te\u015Fekk\xFCrler!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1713827099275264
    m_Localized: "CHAOS Cafe'ye ho\u015F geldiniz!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 537045671178240
    m_Localized: "Sipari\u015Fe 0,75$ eklenir"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536900430819328
    m_Localized: "15 Dolara Krem \u015Eanti Sat\u0131n Al\u0131n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 536982903418880
    m_Localized: "Krem \u015Fanti"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648740309233664
    m_Localized: "Barista'n\u0131z\u0131 olabildi\u011Fince b\xFCy\xFCtt\xFCn\xFCz! 
      Tam potansiyeline ula\u015Ft\u0131ktan sonra mand\u0131ran\u0131za tam zamanl\u0131
      olarak kat\u0131lmaktan ve ekibinize kaliteli bir inek k\u0131z daha eklemekten
      mutluluk duyuyor!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648943238049792
    m_Localized: Oynamaya devam et
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1649229939699712
    m_Localized: "Ana men\xFC"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1649612644773888
    m_Localized: "Daha Az \u0130statistik"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1649493451042816
    m_Localized: "Daha Fazla \u0130statistik"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1649079095750656
    m_Localized: Tekrar oyna
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648511212154880
    m_Localized: Tebrikler!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 132749943507623936
    m_Localized: "Otomatik D\xFCzeltme K\u0131yafeti"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133847671285325824
    m_Localized: Geri
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133992920209006592
    m_Localized: Temel bilgiler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133054867663593472
    m_Localized: 'En iyi zaman: '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1663386760081408
    m_Localized: "Ac\u0131 Kahve"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1660668985307136
    m_Localized: "G\xFCne Ba\u015Flaman\u0131n En \u0130yi Yolu:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133035131357732864
    m_Localized: "Her k\u0131yafeti sat\u0131n al\u0131n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1664405879484416
    m_Localized: "Sakinle\u015Ftirici \xC7ay"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1655899071803392
    m_Localized: Kamera Hareketi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 132868178831843328
    m_Localized: "G\xFCndelik"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 269928791109632
    m_Localized: "Bazen rahatlamak istemekte sorun yoktur.\nFarkl\u0131 se\xE7eneklerle
      oynaman\u0131z\u0131 kolayla\u015Ft\u0131ran daha ucuz ve tutarl\u0131 fiyatlar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 269706832736256
    m_Localized: "Basit E\u011Flence Zorluk"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 231828173975552
    m_Localized: "G\xFCnl\xFCk Mod"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 132870694181117952
    m_Localized: Kaos
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 273385908432896
    m_Localized: "Oh hay\u0131r.\nL\xFCtfen, bu d\xFCnyada iyi olan her \u015Feyin
      a\u015Fk\u0131na, bana en az\u0131ndan \xF6nce Normal Modu oynad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131z\u0131
      s\xF6yleyin, de\u011Fil mi?  Kendi iyili\u011Fin i\xE7in... l\xFCtfen!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 271100448960512
    m_Localized: "Kaos Zorlu\u011Fu"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
