  - m_Id: 133847226483580928
    m_Localized: "E\u011Fiticiden \xC7\u0131k"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1663192102432768
    m_Localized: Ekstra Mola
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1663816466526208
    m_Localized: Peri Latte
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133035857651802112
    m_Localized: "Tan\u0131d\u0131k y\xFCzler"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133037143440859136
    m_Localized: "Ger\xE7ekten lanetli bir zorluk bulun."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133035644203671552
    m_Localized: "Gizli Kaos Zorlu\u011Funu bulun."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1641101533736960
    m_Localized: "Sipari\u015Fi Bitir"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1658724845711360
    m_Localized: "K\u0131yafeti Onar"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133035056309051392
    m_Localized: "Tam Gard\u0131rop"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1664587954221056
    m_Localized: "Doluluk Tolerans\u0131+"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1655422749863936
    m_Localized: Tam ekran
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 132753240020852736
    m_Localized: "Oyun \u0130lerlemesi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1653921176449024
    m_Localized: Genel Ayarlar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 132753222291529728
    m_Localized: "Genel \u0130statistikler"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1653487506386944
    m_Localized: Pes etmek
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1663268698812416
    m_Localized: Mutluluk+
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1677334284693504
    m_Localized: "Barista'n\u0131n ruh halini iyile\u015Ftirin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 132870565030109184
    m_Localized: Zor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 269212714364928
    m_Localized: "M\xFC\u015Fteriler daha se\xE7ici, Barista ise daha karamsar ama
      bu sefer daha da b\xFCy\xFCyebilir!\nNormal Mod'dan biraz daha zorlu bir m\xFCcadele."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 269021949030400
    m_Localized: Zor Zorluk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 231467803570176
    m_Localized: Zor Mod
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1660536202031104
    m_Localized: "Gizemli Etkileri Vard\u0131r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1658430149718016
    m_Localized: "Diyalo\u011Fu Gizle"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19834399893057536
    m_Localized: Tatil Modu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1657977076805632
    m_Localized: "\u0130\xE7indekiler:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 286927487332352
    m_Localized: Dil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133036188431392768
    m_Localized: "Her \u015Feye sahip bir i\xE7ecek haz\u0131rlay\u0131n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133036853224382464
    m_Localized: "Kafe su basana kadar s\xFCt yap."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133036805832941568
    m_Localized: Dalgalar Yarat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1660808559161344
    m_Localized: "\xC7al\u0131\u015Fan\u0131 Y\xF6net"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1660182504763392
    m_Localized: "Y\xF6netmek"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1662860714668032
    m_Localized: Maksimum Boyut+
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1677111105777664
    m_Localized: "Barista'n\u0131n s\xFCt kapasitesini art\u0131r\u0131n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1662565540524032
    m_Localized: "S\xFCtl\xFC kahve"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1677736099016704
    m_Localized: "Barista'y\u0131 hemen doldurun."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133031481403088896
    m_Localized: "S\xFCt a\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 132754228769300480
    m_Localized: "\xDCretilen S\xFCt:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1661098758860800
    m_Localized: "S\xFCt Tipi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 132867783132815360
    m_Localized: "S\xFCtl\xFC"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 229470362759168
    m_Localized: "S\xFCtl\xFC Mod"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 230078679445504
    m_Localized: "S\xFCtl\xFC Mod Etkin:\nBarista giderek daha h\u0131zl\u0131 dolarken
      h\u0131z\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 test edin.  Ona ayak uydurabilir misin?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 132865505260838912
    m_Localized: "Kazan\u0131lan Para:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133035228871106560
    m_Localized: "Ay poli\xE7esi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1663875916591104
    m_Localized: "\u015Eimdi Daha Fazla S\xFCt!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1655167128006656
    m_Localized: "M\xFCzik"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133998653654802432
    m_Localized: "Baristan\u0131z\u0131 Y\xF6netmek"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133998700043804672
    m_Localized: "Nihai hedefiniz baristan\u0131z\u0131 tam potansiyeline \xE7\u0131karmakt\u0131r,
      ancak \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131rken onun mutlulu\u011Funu da ihmal edemezsiniz. 
      Bir s\xFCt \xFCr\xFCnleri pozisyonunda terfi kazanmak umuduyla bu i\u015Fi
      kabul etti, ancak bu onun hayalindeki i\u015F olsa bile, \xE7ok mutsuz olursa
      burada kalmayacakt\u0131r.\n\nBoyutu ve s\xFCt \xFCretiminde ilerleme kaydederken
      ruh halini dengede tutmak, m\xFC\u015Fterileri mutlu etmek ve d\xFCzenli olarak
      bo\u015Falt\u0131lmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011Flamak moralinin y\xFCksek kalmas\u0131na
      yard\u0131mc\u0131 olacakt\u0131r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133998785406279680
    m_Localized: "Baristan\u0131z\u0131n mutlulu\u011Funu ve toklu\u011Funu buradan
      takip edebilirsiniz.  Mutlulu\u011Fu 0'a d\xFC\u015Ferse istifa eder.\n\nHer
      ne kadar b\xFCy\xFCmek istese de, onu her zaman \xE7ok dolu tutamazs\u0131n\u0131z,
      yoksa a\u011Fr\u0131 onu \xFCzer, ama ayn\u0131 zamanda onu s\xFCrekli tamamen
      bo\u015F da tutmamal\u0131s\u0131n\u0131z, yoksa bu da onu \xFCzebilir. bu
      y\xFCzden bir denge kurmaya \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133847557804236800
    m_Localized: Sonraki
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133055089148010496
    m_Localized: "Kay\u0131t yok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 132870450861154304
    m_Localized: Normal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 266676540370944
    m_Localized: "Barista'n\u0131z olabildi\u011Fince b\xFCy\xFCyene veya sinirlenip
      istifa edene kadar oynay\u0131n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 266450740015104
    m_Localized: Normal Zorluk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 231298777313280
    m_Localized: Normal Mod
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133036121565798400
    m_Localized: "Her\u015Feyden Biri"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 224355836850176
    m_Localized: "Se\xE7enekler"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1661378443440128
    m_Localized: "K\u0131yafet Rengi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1661525407657984
    m_Localized: "Pantolon Tarz\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652064190296064
    m_Localized: DURAKLATILDI
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133034562396200960
    m_Localized: "Oyunu uzun s\xFCre oynay\u0131n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133031655290544128
    m_Localized: "100 L'den fazla S\xFCt \xFCretin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1663505232392192
    m_Localized: "\xDCretme-"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1677541911130112
    m_Localized: "Daha d\xFC\u015F\xFCk Barista s\xFCt \xFCretim oran\u0131."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1662658687627264
    m_Localized: "\xDCretim+"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1676894453198848
    m_Localized: "Barista'n\u0131n s\xFCt \xFCretim oran\u0131n\u0131 art\u0131r\u0131n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133036731409211392
    m_Localized: "Onun ger\xE7ek en b\xFCy\xFCk boyutuna ula\u015F\u0131n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 132867593416056832
    m_Localized: "D\xFCzenli"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1640869886521344
    m_Localized: "Barda\u011F\u0131 S\u0131f\u0131rla"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1656078697066496
    m_Localized: "S\xFCreleri S\u0131f\u0131rla"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1655301924548608
    m_Localized: "\xC7\xF6z\xFCn\xFCrl\xFCk"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1653300364931072
    m_Localized: "Tekrar ba\u015Flat"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 132752649106333696
    m_Localized: Kum havuzu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133036482359828480
    m_Localized: "Korumal\u0131 Alan Modu"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 132752870515253248
    m_Localized: "Skorlar ve \u0130statistikler"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1660439854673920
    m_Localized: "Gizli \u015Eeker"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 132753744281051136
    m_Localized: "Bulunan S\u0131rlar"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133036011389820928
    m_Localized: "T\xFCm \xE7apraz m\xFC\u015Fterileri g\xF6r\xFCn."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133034908078153728
    m_Localized: "1000 \u0130\xE7ecek sat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1652825364197376
    m_Localized: Ayar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1658332258856960
    m_Localized: "Diyalo\u011Fu G\xF6ster"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648188082974720
    m_Localized: "Tekrar g\xF6ster?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1655796151971840
    m_Localized: "Zamanlay\u0131c\u0131y\u0131 G\xF6ster"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1654868065742848
    m_Localized: Sesler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 227953312362496
    m_Localized: "\xD6zel te\u015Fekk\xFCr"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 234396560224256
    m_Localized: "Ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1662771174666240
    m_Localized: "Esnek \u015Eeker"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133036677680177152
    m_Localized: "S\xFCper boyutlu"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1656401700417536
    m_Localized: Doku kalitesi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 132865470217428992
    m_Localized: "Oynanan S\xFCre:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1677955096211456
    m_Localized: "Barista mutlulu\u011Fu daha yava\u015F kaybeder."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 231146272419840
    m_Localized: "\xF6\u011Fretici"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133992199195566080
    m_Localized: "Yak\u0131n zamanda yeni bir kafe a\xE7m\u0131\u015F ve bu yeni
      inek k\u0131z\u0131 buradaki ilk baristan\u0131z olarak i\u015Fe alm\u0131\u015Fsan\u0131z,
      g\xF6reviniz baristan\u0131z\u0131n m\xFC\u015Fterilere hizmet etmesine yard\u0131mc\u0131
      olurken onu mutlu etmesini sa\u011Flamakt\u0131r.  Haz\u0131r oldu\u011Funda
      \xE7iftli\u011Finizde daha verimli bir pozisyona terfi etmek istiyor gibi g\xF6r\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCnden,
      i\u015Fi b\u0131rakmad\u0131\u011F\u0131ndan emin olmak \xF6nemlidir.\n\nOyunla
      ilgili belirsiz g\xF6r\xFCnen herhangi bir \u015Fey varsa, bu e\u011Fitimde
      yard\u0131m bulabilece\u011Finizi umuyoruz.  Aksi takdirde hemen oyuna girmeyi
      deneyebilir ve deneme yan\u0131lma yoluyla oyunu \xF6\u011Frenmeye ba\u015Flayabilirsiniz."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133993158466445312
    m_Localized: "Oynamak i\xE7in ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z olan her \u015Fey bir fare
      olmal\u0131d\u0131r; ba\u015Fka hi\xE7bir tu\u015Fa gerek yoktur.\n\nHerhangi
      bir \u015Fey i\xE7in ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z olan ekstra bilgi varsa, Normal
      Mod'da pek \xE7ok yararl\u0131 bilgi sa\u011Flayan Ara\xE7 \u0130pu\xE7lar\u0131
      bulunur.\n\xC7o\u011Fu mekanizmay\u0131 yaln\u0131zca Ara\xE7 \u0130pucu yard\u0131m\u0131yla
      \xE7\xF6zebilirsiniz.\n\n(Dokunmatik Kontroller test edilmedi, ancak bunu bir
      telefonda g\xF6r\xFCyorsan\u0131z en az\u0131ndan k\u0131smen \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131yor
      olmal\u0131lar san\u0131r\u0131m?)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133995531494596608
    m_Localized: "Oyun s\u0131ras\u0131ndaki as\u0131l g\xF6rev i\xE7ecekleri kar\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rmakt\u0131r.\n\nHer
      m\xFC\u015Fterinin ruh halini g\xF6steren bir portresi vard\u0131r ve bu grafikle
      temsil edilen bir sipari\u015F ister.\n\nHer bir malzemenin dolum miktarlar\u0131na
      ve bunlara hangi ekstralar\u0131n eklenmesini istediklerine \xE7ok dikkat edin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133996458540638208
    m_Localized: "\u0130\u015Fte malzemeleriniz.  Oynarken bir barda\u011F\u0131
      doldurmaya ba\u015Flamak i\xE7in t\u0131klay\u0131p bas\u0131l\u0131 tutun
      veya belirli malzemeleri i\xE7ece\u011Fe eklemek i\xE7in bir kez t\u0131klay\u0131n.\n\nKafeniz
      yeni a\xE7\u0131ld\u0131 ve h\xE2l\xE2 birka\xE7 malzeme stoklamas\u0131 gerekiyor. 
      Hepsinin kilidini a\xE7acak kadar kazanmaya \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131n.\n\nYeni
      malzemeler sat\u0131n almak daha fazla para kazanmak i\xE7in \xF6nemlidir;
      i\xE7ecek ne kadar karma\u015F\u0131ksa de\u011Feri de o kadar y\xFCksek olur."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133997655410450432
    m_Localized: "M\xFC\u015Fteriniz i\xE7in doldurdu\u011Funuz bardakt\u0131r, i\xE7ecek
      haz\u0131rlarken dolum \xE7izgilerini kullanarak i\xE7ece\u011Finizi m\xFC\u015Fterinin
      iste\u011Fine ne kadar do\u011Fru \u015Fekilde kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131rabilirsiniz.\n\n\u0130\xE7ece\u011Fin
      do\u011Frulu\u011Fu, derecelendirmeyi ve ne kadar paraya sat\u0131laca\u011F\u0131n\u0131
      etkiler."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 132870790192930816
    m_Localized: Ultra Kaos
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 274821425754112
    m_Localized: "Tamam bu sefer C\u0130DD\u0130 \u015Fekilde bunu bulmaman gerekiyordu. 
      E\u011Fer kalbinizde biraz \xF6z sevgi kald\u0131ysa bunu denemeyin bile."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 274592542584832
    m_Localized: Ultra Kaos Zorluk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133037091288883200
    m_Localized: Ultra Kaos...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133036564937285632
    m_Localized: "Gizli Sandbox Modunun kilidini a\xE7\u0131n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1660890163539968
    m_Localized: "G\xFCncelleme"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1658553181237248
    m_Localized: "Barista'y\u0131 g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFCle"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1658635091800064
    m_Localized: "Oyunu G\xF6r\xFCnt\xFCle"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 132748730527490048
    m_Localized: "Ses Hatlar\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1656601168932864
    m_Localized: Vsync
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133991633908244480
    m_Localized: "Arcade Modu E\u011Fitimine Ho\u015F Geldiniz"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133034372322926592
    m_Localized: Fazla Mesai
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 134010572390375424
    m_Localized: "M\xFC\u015Fteri servisi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 134010918655336448
    m_Localized: "Ayr\u0131ca m\xFC\u015Fterinin ruh halini de izlemeye \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131n,
      buradaki insanlar bir k\u0131z\u0131n b\xFCy\xFCk ve dolgun g\xF6r\xFCnmesini
      seviyor gibi g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCyor, o kadar \xE7arp\u0131c\u0131 ki bedenine g\xF6re
      denge zaman ge\xE7tik\xE7e m\xFC\u015Fterilerin dikkatini \xE7ekecektir.\n\nPeki
      mutlu m\xFC\u015Fterilerin anlam\u0131 nedir?  E\u011Fer ruh halleri buna izin
      veriyorsa, i\xE7kilerinde fazladan bir \u015Feyler isteyebilirler!  \xC7ok
      para de\u011Ferinde \xF6zel bir malzeme...!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 134011413927141376
    m_Localized: "Zamanlanm\u0131\u015F Etkinlikler"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 134011680659709952
    m_Localized: "Bazen oynarken zamanlanm\u0131\u015F olaylar ortaya \xE7\u0131kabilir.\n\nBu
      etkinliklerden baz\u0131lar\u0131 zorluk kat\u0131yor, baz\u0131lar\u0131 size
      gerekli molay\u0131 veriyor ve baz\u0131lar\u0131 ise biraz sa\xE7ma.\nOlan
      biteni takip edin ve bunlara haz\u0131rl\u0131ks\u0131z yakalanmamaya \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131n!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 134179468267331584
    m_Localized: "Arcade modunda oynarken y\xF6netim d\xFC\u011Fmesi, baristan\u0131z
      i\xE7in t\xFCm y\xFCkseltmelerinizin ve \xF6zelle\u015Ftirmelerinizin bulundu\u011Fu
      yerdir.  Kapasitesini ve \xFCretim h\u0131z\u0131n\u0131 artt\u0131rmak orada
      bulunabilir.  Ruh hali g\xFC\xE7lendiricilerle birlikte.\n\nAyr\u0131ca k\u0131yafet
      se\xE7enekleri ve renk se\xE7eneklerini i\xE7eren bir ki\u015Fiselle\u015Ftirme
      men\xFCs\xFC de i\xE7erir.\nBaz\u0131 \xF6zelle\u015Ftirme se\xE7eneklerinin
      kilidinin a\xE7\u0131lmas\u0131 gerekebilir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 134179994149167104
    m_Localized: "Oyunu ba\u015Flatmak"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 134180089527640064
    m_Localized: "E\u011Fitim Tamamland\u0131"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 134180290938118144
    m_Localized: "Bu, a\xE7\u0131kl\u0131\u011Fa kavu\u015Fturulmaya de\u011Fer t\xFCm
      \xF6nemli bilgilerle ilgili olmal\u0131d\u0131r.\nOyunun d\xF6ng\xFCs\xFC a\xE7\u0131k
      olmal\u0131, i\xE7ki yap, para kazan, daha fazla i\xE7ki yap, baristay\u0131
      b\xFCy\xFCt, daha da fazla para kazan, m\xF6\xF6'ye kadar tekrarla.\n\nE\u011Fer
      bir meydan okuma istiyorsan\u0131z, en iyi zamanlar\u0131 elde etmek i\xE7in
      ak\u0131ll\u0131 stratejiler bulmaya veya rotalar\u0131 y\xFCkseltmeye \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131n. 
      E\u011Flenceyi artt\u0131rmak istiyorsan\u0131z di\u011Fer k\u0131yafet se\xE7eneklerinden
      baz\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131n kilidini a\xE7may\u0131 deneyin!  Her iki durumda
      da s\xFCtl\xFC kahvenizin tad\u0131n\u0131 \xE7\u0131kar\u0131n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 135009184603807744
    m_Localized: "Sat\u0131n almak?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
