      sadece do\u011Fru miktarda!@Spoken_Sigh_Happy; S\xFCt\xFCm\xFCn b\xFCy\xFCs\xFC
      ekstra bir lezzet katar!@Reactions_Ooooh; \xD6zel dokunu\u015Fumu ekliyorum,
      bu i\xE7ece\u011Fi y\xFCkseltmek i\xE7in!@Spoken_Sigh_Happy; Biraz s\xFCt,
      \xE7ok sevgi!@Reactions_mmmm; S\xFCt, m\xFCkemmelli\u011Fin gizli bile\u015Feni!@Spoken_Sigh_Happy;
      \u0130\u015Fte, harika bir s\xFCt \xF6rne\u011Fi!@Reactions_mmmm; S\xFCt\xFCm\xFCn
      b\xFCy\xFCs\xFC bug\xFCn \xE7ok g\xFC\xE7l\xFC!@Reactions_Ooooh; Kremams\u0131
      bir dokunu\u015F, tam olarak istedi\u011Finiz gibi!@Spoken_Sigh_Happy; S\xFCt
      var, ve s\xFCt olacak!@Spoken_Sigh_Happy; Hassas sa\u011F\u0131m en iyi \u015Fekilde!@Spoken_Sigh_Happy;
      Muu-velous! Bir damla daha kupa i\xE7inde.@Moo_Happier; S\xFCtten dikkat edin!
      Kaygan!@Spoken_Sigh_Happy; Sadece bir dokunu\u015F inek mutlulu\u011Fu!@Reactions_mmmm;
      \xC7ok lezzetli, kat\u0131lm\u0131yor musunuz?@Spoken_Sigh_Happy; S\xFCt f\u0131\u015Fk\u0131rmas\u0131
