  - m_Id: 219428063652368384
    m_Localized: "Kendimi \xE7ok k\xFC\xE7\xFCk hissediyorum.@Spoken_Ah; Bana b\xFCy\xFCmeme
      yard\u0131m edece\u011Fine s\xF6z verdin, de\u011Fil mi?@Spoken_Ah; O \xF6zel
